  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EFI F&#xf6;r en demokratisk &#xf6;verg&#xe5;ng i Syrien</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TOWARDS A DEMOCRATIC TRANSITION IN SYRIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidra till att CS, med fokus p&#xe5;   kvinnor&#xe4;ttsorganisationer, kan bidra aktivt i utvecklingen av en ny   konstitution i Syrien genom att bilda en koalition, bygga kapacitet   av dess medlemsorganisationer samt via p&#xe5;verkansarbete.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to CS, with a focus on  women&apos;s rights organizations, can contribute actively to the          development of a new constitution in Syria by forming a coalition,    build capacity of its member organizations and through advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
